{
  "title": "The Most Evil Noble Overturns The Death Flag",
  "description": "High school student Namiki Hiroto found himself possessing, \"Zeke Lagias\" a character from \"Wish Soul\", a game that he had played many times.\n\nZeke is the worst villain in the game, and no matter which route you take, he's a character whose death is certain...\n\nIn order to survive, he tried fixing his personality, but he can only speak like a villain?!\n\n\"...If I really can't avoid making villain-like moves, then I just have to get stronger to survive!!\"\n\nIn order to overturn his death flag, Zeke has to struggle with all his might. His trial begins here!! \n",
